  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHEAR - Science for Humanitarian Emergencies and Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHEAR will support world-leading research and innovations in flood and drought risk monitoring and warning systems in Sub-Saharan Africa and landslip prone regions of South Asia. To enable greater and more effective investment in disaster resilience and earlier action to respond to imminent natural hazards by providing decision makers with enhanced risk mapping and analyses and more reliable warning systems</narrative>
  </description>
